{"page":550,"width":1791,"height":2494,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"충돌-을 해결하는 두 번째 방법은 해시 테이블의 구조를 변경하여 각 버것이 하나 이상의 값을","words":[{"text":"충돌-을","x":214,"y":195,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"해결하는","x":311,"y":195,"width":113,"height":32},{"text":"두","x":434,"y":196,"width":28,"height":31},{"text":"번째","x":475,"y":195,"width":51,"height":32},{"text":"방법은","x":540,"y":194,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"해시","x":635,"y":194,"width":52,"height":32},{"text":"테이블의","x":703,"y":193,"width":109,"height":32},{"text":"구조를","x":825,"y":193,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"변경하여","x":924,"y":191,"width":110,"height":33},{"text":"각","x":1048,"y":191,"width":29,"height":32},{"text":"버것이","x":1090,"y":189,"width":82,"height":34},{"text":"하나","x":1187,"y":188,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"이상의","x":1258,"y":186,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"값을","x":1358,"y":186,"width":60,"height":33}]},{"text":"서장할 수 있도록 하는 것이다. 비것은 여러 가지 방법으로 구현될 수 있다. 체이%(chmmng)은","words":[{"text":"서장할","x":184,"y":249,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"수","x":277,"y":250,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"있도록","x":319,"y":249,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"하는","x":412,"y":250,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"것이다.","x":480,"y":249,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"비것은","x":585,"y":248,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"여러","x":680,"y":248,"width":52,"height":32},{"text":"가지","x":747,"y":248,"width":52,"height":32},{"text":"방법으로","x":815,"y":247,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"구현될","x":938,"y":246,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"수","x":1034,"y":246,"width":29,"height":32},{"text":"있다.","x":1076,"y":245,"width":62,"height":33},{"text":"체이%(chmmng)은","x":1154,"y":241,"width":262,"height":36}]},{"text":"오버플로우 문제를 연결 리스트로 해결한다. 즉, 각 비것에 고정된 슬롯을 할당하는 것이 아니라","words":[{"text":"오버플로우","x":182,"y":305,"width":142,"height":32},{"text":"문제를","x":334,"y":304,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"연결","x":431,"y":304,"width":52,"height":31},{"text":"리스트로","x":498,"y":304,"width":109,"height":32},{"text":"해결한다.","x":618,